sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Trigger as CLI / Scheduler
    participant Orch as RunOrchestrator
    participant Tasks as TaskRepository
    participant HTTP as ResponsibleHttpClient
    participant Remote as Fuente remota
    participant Extract as ExtractionRouter
    participant Facts as FactValidator
    participant Queue as Cola de revision
    participant DB as UnitOfWork / DB
    participant Obs as RunReporter

    Trigger->>Orch: run(source_code, correlation_id)
    Orch->>Tasks: claim_or_create(idempotency_key)
    Tasks-->>Orch: tarea pendiente o reanudada

    alt Fallo transitorio de red
        loop Mientras queden intentos
            Orch->>HTTP: fetch(url, attempt_no)
            HTTP->>Remote: GET limitado
            Remote-->>HTTP: timeout, 429 o 5xx
            HTTP->>DB: registrar intento fallido
            HTTP-->>Orch: error reintentable
            Orch->>Tasks: programar backoff con jitter
        end
        Orch->>Tasks: diferir hasta available_at
        Orch->>Obs: sumar fallo de red
    else Error de extraccion
        Orch->>Extract: extract(document_version)
        Extract-->>Orch: error clasificado
        Orch->>Tasks: incrementar intento
        Orch->>Tasks: reprogramar o marcar fallido
        Orch->>DB: conservar version y diagnostico
        Orch->>Obs: sumar fallo de extraccion
    else Confianza baja
        Orch->>Extract: extract(document_version)
        Extract-->>Orch: candidato con evidencia
        Orch->>Facts: validar y puntuar
        Facts-->>Orch: requires_review true
        Orch->>DB: guardar hecho y evidencia
        Orch->>Queue: upsert por fact_id y motivo
        Queue-->>Orch: item existente o nuevo
        Orch->>Obs: sumar revision requerida
    end

    Orch->>Obs: finalizar corrida parcial
    Obs->>DB: guardar run_report
    DB-->>Obs: commit confirmado
    Obs-->>Trigger: deferred, partial_failure o completed_with_reviews
